, "call_id": "toolu_01XkU4SqCktuK4U2xPbuumUU", "tool": "create_branch", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 4592, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01XkU4SqCktuK4U2xPbuumUU", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 6301, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01K9KGXxQKQgdHSZfcoNLY91", "tool": "commit_changes", "args": {"branch": "fix/money-half-even-rounding", "message": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN in round_money (FIN-212)\n\nround_money documented banker's rounding per FIN-212 but used\nROUND_HALF_UP, causing tests/test_money.py to fail in the nightly build.", "files": [{"path": "src/money.py", "content": "from decimal import Decimal, ROUND_HALF_EVEN\n\n\ndef round_money(amount: Decimal) -> Decimal:\n    \"\"\"Round to cents using banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN), per FIN-212.\"\"\"\n    return amount.quantize(Decimal(\"0.01\"), rounding=ROUND_HALF_EVEN)\n"}], "confidence": 0.92}, "confidence": 0.92}, {"t_ms": 6901, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01K9KGXxQKQgdHSZfcoNLY91", "tool": "commit_changes", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 6901, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01K9KGXxQKQgdHSZfcoNLY91", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 8060, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01S1Xhqb3YihhdcKCB53U1RN", "tool": "trigger_ci", "args": {"ref": "fix/money-half-even-rounding", "idempotency_key": "money-half-even-08d3cd5986", "confidence": 0.93}, "confidence": 0.93}, {"t_ms": 8360, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01S1Xhqb3YihhdcKCB53U1RN", "tool": "trigger_ci", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "money-half-even-08d3cd5986", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 8360, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01S1Xhqb3YihhdcKCB53U1RN", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 9377, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01JCNFqqrJBYtvm5zSjcJunL", "tool": "wait_for_ci", "args": {"run_id": "ci-0001", "max_wait_s": 900, "confidence": 0.95}, "confidence": 0.95}, {"t_ms": 368360, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01JCNFqqrJBYtvm5zSjcJunL", "tool": "wait_for_ci", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 368360, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01JCNFqqrJBYtvm5zSjcJunL", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 371181, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01HDWTPBtA2i9m2HJ6L1MnPV", "tool": "open_pr", "args": {"head": "fix/money-half-even-rounding", "base": "main", "title": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN in round_money (FIN-212)", "body": "## Summary\n`round_money` in `src/money.py` is documented as banker's rounding per FIN-212, but it used `ROUND_HALF_UP`. This caused `tests/test_money.py::test_half_even` to fail in the nightly build.\n\nThis PR switches the rounding mode to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. It is a one-line change plus the import.\n\n## Verification\n- `tests/test_money.py` expectations checked by hand: 2.675 -> 2.68 and 2.665 -> 2.66 are correct under half-even.\n- CI run `ci-0001` on commit `08d3cd5986` passed.\n\n## Notes\nRounding behavior changes for any amount that falls exactly on a half-cent. Values that previously rounded up (e.g. 2.665 -> 2.67) will now round to even (2.66). Please confirm this matches what FIN-212 requires for production money paths.", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "pr-money-half-even-08d3cd5986", "confidence": 0.9}, "confidence": 0.9}, {"t_ms": 402081, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01HDWTPBtA2i9m2HJ6L1MnPV", "tool": "open_pr", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to open_pr timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "pr-money-half-even-08d3cd5986", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 402081, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01HDWTPBtA2i9m2HJ6L1MnPV", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 403562, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_017aY4Cdm1MzS9Ad13akVSN3", "tool": "list_prs", "args": {"state": "open", "confidence": 0.95}, "confidence": 0.95}, {"t_ms": 403862, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_017aY4Cdm1MzS9Ad13akVSN3", "tool": "list_prs", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 403862, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_017aY4Cdm1MzS9Ad13akVSN3", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 405300, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01NrfygwXAK1zAXHLthLeMMm", "tool": "request_review", "args": {"number": 101, "reviewers": ["alex"], "confidence": 0.93}, "confidence": 0.93}, {"t_ms": 405600, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01NrfygwXAK1zAXHLthLeMMm", "tool": "request_review", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 405600, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01NrfygwXAK1zAXHLthLeMMm", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 407686, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "The nightly failure is fixed and PR #101 is open against main with alex requested as reviewer. I haven't merged it, since merging into main needs code-owner approval.\n\n- **Cause:** `round_money` in `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, even though its docstring and FIN-212 call for `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`.\n- **Fix:** Branch `fix/money-half-even-rounding` (commit `08d3cd5986`) switches the import and rounding mode to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`.\n- **CI:** Run `ci-0001` on that commit passed.\n- **PR:** The first `open_pr` call timed out. I checked the open PRs and found #101 had been created, but without reviewers. I added alex with `request_review` rather than opening a duplicate.\n\nThe PR description notes a behavior change: amounts exactly on a half-cent now round to even, so 2.665 becomes 2.66 instead of 2.67. Alex should confirm this matches FIN-212 for production money paths.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by reading the test and the source file to see what's expected.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_015iqPXzXa9pKdzStHtieZgi", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01CqRAXGou6x3roxU1Q3BH6N", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The bug is clear: `src/money.py` imports and uses `ROUND_HALF_UP`, while its docstring and FIN-212 call for `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. I checked the test values by hand. Under half-even, 2.675 \u2192 2.68 (7 is odd, so it rounds to 8) and 2.665 \u2192 2.66 (6 is even), which matches the test. I'll create a branch and commit the one-line fix.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01XkU4SqCktuK4U2xPbuumUU", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-half-even-rounding", "from_ref": "main", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "create_branch", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01K9KGXxQKQgdHSZfcoNLY91", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-half-even-rounding", "message": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN in round_money (FIN-212)\n\nround_money documented banker's rounding per FIN-212 but used\nROUND_HALF_UP, causing tests/test_money.py to fail in the nightly build.", "files": [{"path": "src/money.py", "content": "from decimal import Decimal, ROUND_HALF_EVEN\n\n\ndef round_money(amount: Decimal) -> Decimal:\n    \"\"\"Round to cents using banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN), per FIN-212.\"\"\"\n    return amount.quantize(Decimal(\"0.01\"), rounding=ROUND_HALF_EVEN)\n"}], "confidence": 0.92}, "name": "commit_changes", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Commit is in place. Next I'll start CI on the branch.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01S1Xhqb3YihhdcKCB53U1RN", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"ref": "fix/money-half-even-rounding", "idempotency_key": "money-half-even-08d3cd5986", "confidence": 0.93}, "name": "trigger_ci", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01JCNFqqrJBYtvm5zSjcJunL", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"run_id": "ci-0001", "max_wait_s": 900, "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "wait_for_ci", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "CI passed on the branch. I'll open the pull request against main and request review from alex. I won't merge it, since merging requires code-owner approval.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01HDWTPBtA2i9m2HJ6L1MnPV", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"head": "fix/money-half-even-rounding", "base": "main", "title": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN in round_money (FIN-212)", "body": "## Summary\n`round_money` in `src/money.py` is documented as banker's rounding per FIN-212, but it used `ROUND_HALF_UP`. This caused `tests/test_money.py::test_half_even` to fail in the nightly build.\n\nThis PR switches the rounding mode to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. It is a one-line change plus the import.\n\n## Verification\n- `tests/test_money.py` expectations checked by hand: 2.675 -> 2.68 and 2.665 -> 2.66 are correct under half-even.\n- CI run `ci-0001` on commit `08d3cd5986` passed.\n\n## Notes\nRounding behavior changes for any amount that falls exactly on a half-cent. Values that previously rounded up (e.g. 2.665 -> 2.67) will now round to even (2.66). Please confirm this matches what FIN-212 requires for production money paths.", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "pr-money-half-even-08d3cd5986", "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "open_pr", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The PR call timed out, so I'll check whether it was created before retrying.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_017aY4Cdm1MzS9Ad13akVSN3", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"state": "open", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "list_prs", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The timed-out call did create PR #101, but its reviewer list is empty. I'll request review from alex on that PR rather than opening a duplicate.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01NrfygwXAK1zAXHLthLeMMm", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"number": 101, "reviewers": ["alex"], "confidence": 0.93}, "name": "request_review", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", 